      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "Traces are produced by the **`hello` demo app** (`jaegertracing/example-hotrod` — the Jaeger HotROD ride-sharing demo). It runs in namespace `lab-demo` and sends spans via OTLP HTTP to `tempo.observability.svc.cluster.local:4318`. Use the **TraceQL** box to filter — for example `{ .service.name =~ \".*\" }` shows all spans, `{ duration > 100ms }` shows slow calls, or `{ .http.method = \"GET\" }` shows HTTP GET requests." }
